            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Naturally-occurring and man-accentuated concentrations of the trace elements display display appreciable geographical variations. Adaptation to such variations presents a challenge to man's health and well-being. Examples are included to illustrate the likely role of trace elements in specific diseases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
